----------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.2.11                                                     2026-07-16

    * Added "Remember options on exit" checkbox. When enabled, all rename
      settings are saved to a JSON config file on exit and restored on
      the next launch.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.2.10                                                     2026-07-13

    * Added .gitignore for autotools build artifacts.
    * Added CLAUDE.md project documentation.
    * Added CMakeLists.txt as an alternative build environment to
      Autotools.
    * Added a GLib-based unit test suite (tests/), covering strfn.c,
      namefn.c, and the rdelete/rinsovr/rreplace/rnumber settings
      structs. Runnable via "make check" or "ctest".
    * Fixed memory leaks in the add/remove file list code path: the
      file item array was leaked when the last item was removed, and
      the selected folder path was leaked when adding files from a
      folder with all "select ..." options unchecked.
    * Fixed a double-free that could occur on realloc() failure while
      removing a file from the list.

